//
// Each listed beat lies between play.entry and play.finale but has no direct
// play.scenes / play.learn mapping. A beat-tagged divergence may explain the
// adaptation, but does not count as enactment. Listing a beat here
// means exactly one thing: the game does NOT claim to enact that beat as a
// dedicated scene. The faithful event remains in the source timeline. This is
// intentionally not generated by the audit; additions and removals are review
// decisions, and the audit rejects drift in either direction.

